title: "cmb-lcdm-sr: blind symbolic interpretation of CMB beta-VAE latents"
authors:
  - family-names: Xu
    given-names: Ziyu
    email: zx332@cam.ac.uk
    affiliation: University of Cambridge
year: 2026
version: 1.0.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/xulucy317-del/cmb-lcdm-sr"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - cosmic microwave background
  - variational autoencoder
  - symbolic regression
  - mutual information
  - interpretability
abstract: >-
  A pre-registered, fully blind symbolic-regression study of the latent
  variables of two beta-VAE compressors of CMB power spectra. Both the search
  loss and the selection metric are mutual-information estimators, so the
  search is rewarded for functional dependence on the cosmological parameters
  and never for matching the encoder's calibration. The repository holds the
  stored checkpoints, the pipeline, the consolidated results of about 5,100
  PySR searches, a pre-registered linear baseline that re-scopes the
  discovery claims, and the encoder-side attribution study, together with
  the write-up of record.
